            {
              "value": "1",
              "text": "\u975e\u65e2\u5b9a\u4e4b\u9918\u984d\u8b8a\u52d5\u516c\u544a(\u5df2\u77e5\u6089\u6642-\u9918\u984d\u672a\u8b8a\u52d5\u516c\u544a)Expected variation in amount outstanding (for both repurchase from secondary market and repayment of principal on an earlier time)"
            },
            {
              "value": "2",
              "text": "\u975e\u65e2\u5b9a\u4e4b\u9918\u984d\u8b8a\u52d5\u516c\u544a(\u5df2\u5be6\u969b\u8b8a\u52d5-\u4f46\u8b8a\u52d5\u5f8c\u4ecd\u6709\u9918\u984d)Variation in amount outstanding after repurchase from secondary market or partly repay principal on an earlier time"
            },
